# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002379> (spatially coextensive with)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002379> "x spatially_coextensive_with y if and inly if x and y have the same location")
