# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0003001> (produced by)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0003001> "a produced_by b iff some process that occurs_in b has_output a.")
